WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.700
Water Beings · digital ecology
Contact begins the next generation.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Workshop recording · hydraulic push test
Water is pumped into an internal bladder.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.300
The test body clears the opening onto the table.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.900
Separate control test · a hand adjusts the phone interface.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.300
First tank prototype · overhead recording
[A sustained tone enters.]

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.000
Closer framing of the same take.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:53.300
Water appears between the two bodies.
[A second tone follows the widening gap.]

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.600
The smaller body moves around the larger one.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.100
Second prototype · separate tank recording

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:10.100
Installation photograph · IEEE VIS Arts Program

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:19.100
Water Beings · digital population
